# ─── Secrets / local config ───────────────────────────────
# NOTE: config.json / enhanced_config.json are ALSO already committed in git
# history (public repo). Full remediation (git rm --cached + history scrub +
# rotate) is the deferred "secret remediation" task (user-only). Listed here
# to stop FUTURE commits of those, and to keep the newer local/runtime files
# (never committed so far) from ever being added by accident.
config.json
config - Copy.json
enhanced_config.json
.github/test_config.json
config.local.json
browser_profile/
profiles/
watch_runs/
*.lock
*state.json
naukri_heartbeat.txt
*.previous
